# Sinkhole Surveyor ({1}{B}, 1/3 flying): "Whenever this creature attacks, you lose 1 life and this creature endures 1."
# (CR 119.3, 701.63a) Bot1 attacks on turn 3, loses 1 life (19) and takes the counter: a 2/4 that deals 2. Bot2's Memnite has no
# flying or reach, so it cannot block (CR 702.9b).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Sinkhole Surveyor
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sinkhole Surveyor.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
